    mkg:estimationQuote "They were assumed known in the context of this study to limit the model complexity and avoid overfitting and their values were set to 10% of the starting concentrations." ;
    mkg:page "11" ;
    mkg:quote "Coefficients  $ \\delta_A $,  $ \\delta_P $ can be interpreted as the minimal ammonium and phosphate concentration in the medium at which cell growth occurs." ;
    mkg:reason "It is a fixed concentration threshold coefficient in the growth law, set as a proportion of the starting concentration." ;
    mkg:siFactor 1e+00 ;
    mkg:status "accepted" ;
    mkg:symbol "\\delta_{A}" ;
    mkg:unit "mM" ;
    mkg:unitString "mM" .

